<!--
  RM_Bozzuga.xml                                     MIASMA_AMBUSH_FROG_REMAKE_1

  The giant ambush frog, remade as ours (owner card 2026-09-10, the_miasma roster round 2: "keep the
  giant-ambush-frog body plan, new name + alienized art"). Name coined under check_pseudo_sw_name.py
  (PASS shape+collision; Wookieepedia search API: zero hits for "Bozzuga"); the CSV's placeholder id
  RM_MiasmaAmbushFrog is renamed to RM_Bozzuga in the art list. RM_ tier: invented, franchise-free (Q11a).

  Hunting is the VANILLA predator AI (race.predator + maxPreyBodySize 0.6: above the karrolun's 0.35 and the
  nursery juveniles, below any colonist), the same shape as GelatinousSlime's fubbum. Nothing here drives
  behaviour; RM_AmbushFrogHunting only applies the Mod Settings switch (off => race.predator false).
  Its prey are the scuttlers and stranded young that the rest of the Miasma already supplies.
  "Waits in the channels": it is a slow, low animal (low MoveSpeed, short roam) so it ambushes rather than pursues.
  One home: wired ONLY to RM_Miasma.
  Art: flat-colour south-only placeholder; the real job is in miasma_turn1_2026-10-02.csv (id RM_Bozzuga).
-->
