    <description>A squat, wide-mouthed ambusher the colour of wet silt, mottled with salt-white warts, that sits half-sunk in the root-maze channels for days at a time with only its eyes showing. Nothing about it moves until something small comes within a lunge, and then the whole head is mouth. Karrolun, stranded young and anything else small enough to swallow whole are its diet; it has no interest in anything larger.</description>
